WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.042 --> 00:00:11.028
My garden has many visitors.

2
00:00:11.029 --> 00:00:14.291
I say hello to them.

3
00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:18.625
The snail takes his shell everywhere.

4
00:00:18.626 --> 00:00:23.307
Hello, Mr. Snail.

5
00:00:23.308 --> 00:00:27.256
The caterpillar chews on a leaf.

6
00:00:27.257 --> 00:00:33.029
Hello, Mrs. Caterpillar.

7
00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:37.290
The ant takes some food to his family.

8
00:00:37.291 --> 00:00:41.847
Hello, Mr. Ant.

9
00:00:41.848 --> 00:00:45.405
The spider hangs from her web.

10
00:00:45.406 --> 00:00:51.074
Hello, Mrs. Spider.

11
00:00:51.075 --> 00:00:54.471
The ladybug crawls on the bush.

12
00:00:54.472 --> 00:00:59.337
Hello, Mrs. Ladybug.

13
00:00:59.338 --> 00:01:02.986
The bees buzz around the flowers.

14
00:01:02.987 --> 00:01:08.188
Hello, Mr. and Mrs. Bee.

15
00:01:08.189 --> 00:01:14.896
I like all the visitors in my garden.
